duplication-viz
===============

Between which parts of the project is this code duplicated?

Running
-------

Generate the image:

    node export.js

Run the WebGL2 visualization:

    npx serve .

Then open the URL provided by serve in your browser.

References and sources used in this implementation
--------------------------------------------------

[1] Hierarchical Edge Bundling
    Mike Bostock
    https://gist.github.com/mbostock/1044242
    License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

    The original D3/SVG rendering was replaced with a custom WebGL2 renderer,
    and the hierarchy was adapted for file-based data and duplicated
    relationships.

[2] Hierarchical edge bundling
    from Data to Viz
    https://www.data-to-viz.com/graph/edge_bundling.html

[3] Hierarchical edge bundling
    D3.js Graph Gallery
    https://d3-graph-gallery.com/bundle

[4] Hierarchical Edge Bundles: Visualization of Adjacency Relations in
    Hierarchical Data
    Danny Holten
    IEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics, vol. 12, no. 5,
    2006
    https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/4015425

[5] Well-formed eigenfactor
    Moritz Stefaner, Martin Rosvall, Jevin West and Carl Bergstrom
    Bergstrom Lab, University of Washington, 2009
    https://truth-and-beauty.net/projects/well-formed-eigenfactor
